description:
Make a sync job report what it did with structured logs and counters.

```
{"event": "sync.start", "run": "r1"}
{"event": "record.sent", "run": "r1", "id": 1, "ms": 12}
{"event": "record.failed", "run": "r1", "id": 3, "error": "bad email"}
{"event": "sync.end", "run": "r1", "sent": 2, "failed": 1, "ms": 40}
```
